      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOODTIME LOUIS (2) is a newcomer to the Jason Grimson yard from WA where he recorded back to-back placings at Gloucester Park last month. Readied with a nice trial and should get his chance from the good draw. ULTIMATE CRUZA (3) scored at Newcastle three starts ago and continued his solid form when he came from this barrier for a 3.5m fourth here last week. Up in distance but draws for another good result. BARTELLO (5) is going well, winning here two back and finishing third from a similar barrier last time out. Has won at this longer trip three times before. ERUPT STRIDE NZ (7) draws wider but could be close to a win after a narrow defeat here last time and the longer distance might suit him.",
